 DM_EMBED_TAG	path	Set by the iOS app of a game of several programs: the tag of the running program's embedded sections (`p<N>`, `gen_embed.py --tag`)
@@ -65,6 +69,8 @@ DM_GL_DRAWLOG	diagnostic	`=<n>[:<seconds>]` logs the first `<n>` GL draws after
